    "summary": "Summary: Implemented stable per-task/content-hash evidence keys, superseded-row compaction, shared-evidence loop prevention, and a configurable 6,000-character evidence cap.\n\nFiles changed:\n\n- `.orchestrator/pool.toml`\n- `orchestrator/evidence.py`\n- `orchestrator/spawn.py`\n- `tests/test_evidence.py`\n- `tests/test_spawn.py`\n\nGate result: **red** after the maximum two permitted runs. The task-specific regression passed; the final run failed an unrelated threshold test that passed on the first run.\n\nCommit: `0a33640212ffae6f7eac24cdb574bd289cd42621`\n\nFailures-only test output:\n\n```text\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n    raise RuntimeError(\"boom\")\nRuntimeError: boom\nFAIL: test_localized_fix_reduces_and_keeps_scope_full (test_context_eval.ContextEval.test_localized_fix_reduces_and_keeps_scope_full)\nTraceback (most recent call last):\nAssertionError: 0.144 not greater than or equal to 0.4\nFAILED (failures=1)\n```",
